            </div> 
            <div class="subject">
            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    It replaced “[a] wrongful <b>act</b> or an insult” with “[c]onduct of the victim that would constitute an indictable offence under this <b>Act</b> that is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment”. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;The amending legislation contained no <b>transitional</b> provisions with respect to s. 232: Zero Tolerance for Barbaric Cultural Practices <b>Act</b>, S.C. 2015, c. 29. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;Whatever may be the outer reaches of “wrongful <b>act</b>”, the term would seem to include an unlawful <b>act</b>, a criminal offence under the Criminal Code. 
