            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    138 (4) Where a <b>proceeding</b> is commenced before this <b>section</b> comes into force, this <b>section</b> does not apply and <b>section</b> 36 of the Judicature <b>Act</b>, being chapter 223 of the Revised States of Ontario, 1980, continues to apply, notwithstanding <b>section</b> 187. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;8 (1) The amendments to the Courts of Justice <b>Act</b>, 1984, as enacted by this <b>Act</b>, except for the amendments enacted by <b>section</b> 1, <b>section</b> 4 and subsection 6(2), apply to causes of action arising after the 23rd day of October, 1989. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) The amendments to the Courts of Justice <b>Act</b>, 1984, as enacted by <b>section</b> 4 and subsection 6(2) of this <b>Act</b>, apply to, 
                </p>
                <div class="spacer">
                        <span class="decisia-icon"></span>
                        <span class="decisia-icon"></span>
                </div>
        </div> 
